{%- comment -%}
  snippets/portal-more-sheet.liquid — the mobile overflow sheet (spec task 19.1,
  design §17.4, §19.8).

  Requirements 17.3, 17.4, 17.9, 25.4, 25.8.

  ── WHY A `<dialog>` ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  §17.4: "The **More** sheet is a `<dialog>` (§19.8), so it inherits a focus trap,
  `Esc` and a backdrop rather than reimplementing them." `ui/sheet.ts` (task 18.5)
  drives it, so the behaviour is the same one the redemption and address sheets get.

  ── IT DEGRADES TO A VISIBLE LIST ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  A `<dialog>` without `open` is hidden by the user agent, which would strand a
  phone customer whose bundle failed to execute — the four demoted entries would be
  unreachable, and the bottom bar exists precisely so navigation survives a script
  failure (task 19.1).

  So the four hrefs are ALSO rendered in the bottom bar's overflow items, which CSS
  hides only when the viewport is wide enough to show all eight. The sheet is a
  convenience on top of markup that already works, not the only route. That is why
  the same four links appear twice in the DOM: one copy is the fallback.

  The duplicate is scoped and labelled, so a screen reader user does not meet eight
  identical links — the sheet is `aria-modal` and inert until opened, so only one
  copy is in the accessibility tree at a time.

  ── THE DISMISS CONTROL IS NOT OPTIONAL (Requirement 25.8) ────────────────────
  `data-portal-sheet-dismiss` is what `ui/sheet.ts` binds. Backdrop-only dismissal
  is undiscoverable on touch and impossible with a keyboard, and `Esc` alone is not
  an affordance because nothing on screen says it exists.

  PARAMETERS
    current  the `nav_key` of the page being rendered
{%- endcomment -%}

<dialog class="athoor-portal__sheet" id="AthoorPortalMore" aria-labelledby="AthoorPortalMoreTitle">
  <div class="athoor-portal__sheet-inner">
    <h2 class="athoor-portal__sheet-title" id="AthoorPortalMoreTitle" data-portal-sheet-heading>More</h2>

    <ul class="athoor-portal__sheet-list" role="list">
      {%- assign overflow_items = 'referrals,fragrance,profile,settings' | split: ',' -%}
      {%- for item in overflow_items -%}
        {%- liquid
          case item
            when 'referrals'
              assign label = 'Referrals'
              assign href = '/pages/my-athoor-referrals'
            when 'fragrance'
              assign label = 'Fragrance profile'
              assign href = '/pages/my-athoor-fragrance'
            when 'profile'
              assign label = 'Profile'
              assign href = '/pages/my-athoor-profile'
            when 'settings'
              assign label = 'Settings'
              assign href = '/pages/my-athoor-settings'
          endcase
        -%}
        <li class="athoor-portal__sheet-item">
          <a
            class="athoor-portal__sheet-link"
            href="{{ href }}"
            {% if item == current %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}
          >{{ label }}</a>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>

    <button class="athoor-portal__sheet-dismiss" type="button" data-portal-sheet-dismiss>Close</button>
  </div>
</dialog>
